# Veltrix Rule File — Hybrid Attack Mutation Rules
# Format: token dipisah spasi, `#` mulai komentar.
# Operasi (lihat src/core/rules.rs untuk definisi eksak):
#   $<n>       — append angka 0..=n  (mis. `$9` -> pass0..pass9; HATI-HATI:
#                `$2024` berarti 2025 mutasi, BUKAN literal "2024")
#   ^<n>       — prepend angka 0..=n
#   @<str>     — append string LITERAL (mis. `@2024` -> pass2024)
#   !<str>     — prepend string LITERAL
#   ~<n>       — case (0=lower, 1=UPPER, 2=Title)
#   &<from>:<to> — leet substitution (mis. `&a:4`)
#   D          — duplicate (pass -> passpass)
#   R          — reverse (pass -> ssap)
#   T<n>       — truncate ke n char pertama (mis. `T4`)
#
# Aturan: pakai `@`/`!` untuk literal tahun/string, `$`/`^` hanya untuk
# range angka KECIL. Total ekspansi selalu dibatasi --max-mutations.
# Order: rules diaplikasikan sekuensial per kata.

# ── Year suffixes (literal!) ──
@2023
@2024
@2025
@2026
@2020
@2019
@2018
@123
@1234
@123456

# ── Small numeric ranges (hati-hati: $9 = 10 mutasi per kata) ──
$9
^9

# ── Common appends ──
@1
@!
@!!
@#
@admin
@pass
@me
@qwerty

# ── Common prepends ──
!admin
!pass
!Admin
!super
!root

# ── Capitalization ──
~1
~2

# ── Leet speak ──
&a:@
&a:4
&e:3
&i:1
&o:0
&s:$
&s:5
&t:7

# ── Shape ops ──
D
R
T8
